+## Round 31 — registry rows for the decision-table gate and self-assessment v2 (2026-10-26; append-only; never edit above)
+
+Round 31 adds one gate and revises one. `check-decision-table.mjs` counts the rows of a knowledge entry's
+decision table (`Row | Signal | Decision | Threshold | Source | Located quote`) whose threshold is the
+source's own number: each row cites one registry row opened after the baseline, its quote is located in
+committed fetch bytes and, with `--live`, in the live page, and the threshold's number occurs in that quote.
